      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Place the regression in the AIO suite exercised by PR CI**\n\nChecked `.github/workflows/aws-torch-latest.yml`: the AIO-capable PR job installs `libaio-dev` at lines 62-64, but its pytest commands select only `tests/unit/v1/` at lines 109-117. Because this regression lives under `tests/unit/ops/aio`, that job never collects it; add the destructor case to the existing `tests/unit/v1/nvme/test_aio_gil.py`, which already contains the same GIL handoff setup and is collected by this workflow.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L67-L67](https://github.com/deepspeedai/DeepSpeed/blob/c9f8ae6af69e1100cb384f9ed9e7000a17f12c75/AGENTS.md#L67-L67)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
